WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
沿着河找一找，哪里最适合停船？
Follow the river. Where could a boat stop?

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:12.000
码头有了人流，街道慢慢接到河岸。
Foot traffic links the growing streets to the wharf.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:18.000
桥把两岸连在一起，人开始往对岸走。
A bridge gives people a route to the far bank.

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:24.000
把四个时刻接起来，就看到了两岸的变化。
Put these moments together to see both banks change.
